Package: YARF
Type: Package
Title: Yet Another Random Forests Package
Version: 1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adam", "Kapelner", email = "kapelner@qc.cuny.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Matt", "Olson", role = "aut"),
    person("Abhinav", "Patil", role = "aut")
    )
Description: A customizable, asynchronous, and parallelized random forest
    implementation. Supports user-defined splitting and aggregation behavior,
    missingness incorporated in attributes, and random-forest-based imputation.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/kapelner/YARF, https://kapelner.github.io/YARF/
BugReports: https://github.com/kapelner/YARF/issues
